        "Content": "<ul><li>Amazing location</li><li>Specatular panoramic views</li><li>Rural setting yet convenient position close to Howth Village</li><li>6 Acres of private land</li><li>Over 4,000sqft of accommodation in total (approx) </li><li>Very private setting with abundant parking </li><li>Double garage fully dry lined and plumbed and wired for power</li><li>Guet house which could be used as a home office or Granny Flat or Home income</li><li>Close to Howth Village and Summit </li><li>The Cliff Path is outside your gate </li><li>Dubin Airport and Dublin City are 18km away</li><li>There are several bus routes that pass nearby and the DART makes Howth very convenient to the city</li><li>There are lots of good schools within walking distance </li><li>Howth Yacht Club and several golf clubs on the penisula make for great recreation time</ul>"
